OL,3,ATonnes of rubble including 'bits of old
OL,4,Atoilets' being dumped in village,
OL,5,Aresidents claim
OL,6,
OL,7,FWales' environmental regulator has
OL,8,Fissued enforcement notices after
OL,9,Freports of waste being dumped in two
OL,10,Fneighbouring villages.
OL,12,FResidents of Coedpoeth, Wrexham, say
OL,13,Fseveral trucks a day have been
OL,14,Fdepositing thousands of tonnes of
OL,15,Fbuilding rubble - including "bits of
OL,16,Fold toilets", plastics and metals - on
OL,17,Fa field at the edge of the village.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
