OL,3,ATonnes of rubble including 'bits of old
OL,4,Atoilets' being dumped in village,
OL,5,Aresidents claim
OL,6,
OL,7,FReg Davies, who lives locally, said
OL,8,Fthere were numerous 40-tonne trucks
OL,9,Fgoing to the site almost every day
OL,10,Fwhich he said was "destroying" the
OL,11,Fvillage.
OL,13,FThe company which owns the site, SOS
OL,14,FAggregates, denied it was dumping waste
OL,15,Fand said it was using "high-grade"
OL,16,Frecycled construction material to
OL,17,Fcreate a training area for horses and a
OL,18,Fstable.
